                      "heading": "Element examples",
                      "intro": "See also: HTML element Header of the HTML document: < head > ... </ head > . The title is included in the head, for example: < head > < title > The Title </ title > < link rel = \"stylesheet\" href = \"stylebyjimbowales.css\" > <!-- Imports Stylesheets --> </ head >",
