                  "heading": "Frameset versus transitional",
                  "intro": "In addition to the above transitional differences, the frameset specifications (whether XHTML 1.0 or HTML 4.01) specify a different content model, with frameset replacing body , that contains either frame elements, or optionally noframes with a body .",
